B.Vm=new A.zS("sun",B.a5V,B.UQ,B.Tq,B.TL,B.RT,B.TO,B.Th,B.T9,14)
B.Nz=new A.bD("The hours before sunrise are called brahma muh\u016brta \u2014 the creator\u2019s time. The air is cool, the house is quiet, and the mind has not yet picked up the worries of the day.",null,null)
B.MX=new A.bD("You do not need to wake at four. Wake fifteen minutes before your usual time. Wash your face, drink a little water, and sit in your chosen place before you touch your phone.",null,null)
B.NA=new A.bD("Begin with three slow breaths. Then chant one short prayer \u2014 the Gayatri, or simply Om eleven times. Finish by sitting quietly for one minute and setting one small intention for the day.",null,null)
B.Ni=new A.bD("That is all. Fifteen minutes, kept every day, will slowly change the colour of everything that follows.",null,null)
B.a7I=s([B.Nz,B.MX,B.NA,B.Ni],t.L4)
B.My=new A.ib("The morning hour",5,B.a7I)
B.MK=new A.bD("Sadhana does not end when you get up from the mat. The morning is the seed; the day is the field where it grows.",null,null)
B.MN=new A.bD("Before you eat, pause for one breath and give thanks. Before a difficult call, silently say your mantra once. While waiting in a queue, count a few breaths instead of reaching for your phone.",null,null)
B.Nm=new A.bD("Work itself can be practice. Do the task in front of you fully, and let go of the praise or blame that may follow. This is the heart of karma yoga.",null,null)
B.MH=new A.bD("Yoga is skill in action.","yoga\u1e25 karmasu kau\u015balam","Bhagavad Gita 2.50")
B.MI=new A.bD("If the day goes badly, do not wait for tomorrow\u2019s practice. Step outside, look at the sky for one minute, and begin again right there.",null,null)
B.a7l=s([B.MK,B.MN,B.Nm,B.MH,B.MI],t.L4)
B.Mt=new A.ib("Practice through the day",33,B.a7l)
B.MD=new A.bD("At sunset, light a lamp. In many homes this is the oldest prayer of all \u2014 a small flame that says the day is done and the dark will be met with light.",null,null)
B.Ne=new A.bD("Sit for five minutes. Look back over the day without judging: one thing that went well, one thing you would do differently, one person to thank.",null,null)
B.MO=new A.bD("Chant something gentle. The Shanti Mantra is a good friend at this hour. Let the three peaces go out \u2014 to yourself, to those around you, and to the whole world.",null,null)
B.Nw=new A.bD("Then put the day down. Go to bed a little earlier than you think you need to. Tomorrow\u2019s morning hour begins tonight.",null,null)
B.a62=s([B.MD,B.Ne,B.MO,B.Nw],t.L4)
B.MA=new A.ib("The evening lamp",64,B.a62)
B.a8K=s([B.My,B.Mt,B.MA],t.n4)
B.NI=new A.l_("daily-sadhana","Daily Sadhana",96,1.9,"Practice","2 Nov 2026",B.Vm,"Short practices for morning, day and evening. Fifteen minutes at sunrise, small pauses through the day and a lamp at sunset \u2014 a simple rhythm anyone can keep, even in a busy home.",B.a8K,!0)
