B.a7_=s(["Rushikulam is a home for learning life through the Vedic and Yogic traditions. It sits in Yellapur, a quiet town in the Western Ghats surrounded by forests and waterfalls.","Its founder believes true education should take a person from depending on others to standing on their own \u2014 the way a child slowly learns from its mother. Rushikulam was started to offer that kind of authentic study and guidance.","Here a student is meant to feel at home, not just enrolled. Old teachings are studied deeply and then practised in daily life."],t.s)
